Day 57 - SSH Timeout Investigation
Objective
Investigate an SSH connection timeout.

Investigation
Verified EC2 instance state
Verified Public IP address
Reviewed Security Group rules
Root Cause
Port 22 was not allowed in the Security Group.

Resolution
Added an SSH rule on Port 22 and verified connectivity.

Key Takeaway
Connection timed out usually indicates a network-related issue rather than an authentication issue.
